   - Commits: 8a13af6c, 0255c389
   - Files:
     - lib/Xm/DragOverS.c
   - What changed:
     - Snap-back animation now returns the drag hotspot to the initial
       pointer location instead of returning the pixmap center.
     - Blended drag icon hotspot now honors XmNhotX/Y from the drag
       context when provided by the application.
     - Temporary debug logging removed (commit 0255c389).
   - Why:
     - Fixes incorrect return animation when applications supply a
       custom drag hotspot (e.g., clicking on the left/right of a large
       icon label caused the pixmap center to return to the click point).

